To download it, open the note’s document/editor view and look for Download or Export, then choose PDF.

I can’t see the exact control state, but the button may be disabled when:

no draft has been generated or loaded yet;
the note is still generating or saving;
required setup information is missing;
proposed edits still need review;
PDF export is not supported for the selected EUCF online-form template; or
you lack edit/export permission.

The current context does not include an active document, so first confirm that the draft appears in the editor. If it does, hover over the disabled button—its tooltip may state the specific requirement.
